	(text "ONE OF FOUR IDENTICAL CLUSTERS. Compound device: no VBUS at the FTDI, no VBUS divider into RESET#.\nVREGOUT -> VCORE is an EXTERNAL connection (4.7 uF compensates the internal LDO).\nVPLL and VPHY are 3.3 V, each on its own ferrite. All four VCCIO pins must be connected.\nTEST hard to GND (floating = factory test mode, never enumerates). Channel D RXD is pin 52, not 49.\nOnly TXD/RXD used per channel; modem pins have internal 40-190k pulls."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f11b5a7f-0a02-519c-9b0d-955db1ae1a54")
	)
	(text "RS-232: MAX3232E (+-15 kV ESD, 250 kbit/s guaranteed). 3-wire: the Cisco console port ignores RTS/CTS.\nFlying caps and V+/V- reservoirs tight to the chip - that is the only layout rule."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 210 22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e595adce-17db-5165-8cc8-253467a4862a")
	)
	(text "CLUSTER BRING-UP HEADER (Rev B): 1 = +3.3V,\n2 = VCC3 (this cluster), 3 = GND. Jumper 1-2 = normal.\nPull it to leave this cluster dark;\nmeter across 1-2 for its current; bench supply on 2-3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325 210 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e5867f9f-40e7-5159-bede-7a3a9ca633ec")
	)
	(text "TP: 1.8 V core, cluster 3.3 V, GND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 133 238 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7c163d32-ba15-5006-b4b1-32a2ac58abde")
	)
